{"id":"f045e001caa19927","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-simple-properties.md","title":"简单集合的不可计算与多一不完全","display":"thm-simple-properties — 简单集合的不可计算与多一不完全","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-simple-properties","aliases":["20-thm-simple-properties"],"display":"thm-simple-properties — 简单集合的不可计算与多一不完全","chapter":"5","section":"5.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Proposition 5.2.2","source_pdf_pages":[144],"source_printed_pages":[109],"depends_on":["[[20-df-simple]]","[[20-df-creative]]","[[20-df-mcomplete]]","[[20-thm-rec-re]]","[[20-thm-productive-properties]]","[[20-thm-creative-mcomplete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-simple-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-simple-properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-simple-properties — 简单集合的不可计算与多一不完全"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Proposition 5.2.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>144</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>109</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f98c8cce12228b4a\" href=\"?note=f98c8cce12228b4a\" title=\"20-df-creative\">20-df-creative</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"15cacf231068cc2e\" href=\"?note=15cacf231068cc2e\" title=\"20-df-mcomplete\">20-df-mcomplete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c99615f5fab6afb5\" href=\"?note=c99615f5fab6afb5\" title=\"20-thm-productive-properties\">20-thm-productive-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"17f36cae84cb8ff3\" href=\"?note=17f36cae84cb8ff3\" title=\"20-thm-creative-mcomplete\">20-thm-creative-mcomplete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Simple}(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R\">\\(\\mathcal R\\)</span> 是可计算集合族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Creative}\">\\(\\operatorname{Creative}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mComplete}\">\\(\\operatorname{mComplete}\\)</span> 采用所引定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f98c8cce12228b4a\" href=\"?note=f98c8cce12228b4a\" title=\"20-df-creative\">20-df-creative</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"15cacf231068cc2e\" href=\"?note=15cacf231068cc2e\" title=\"20-df-mcomplete\">20-df-mcomplete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"550ce05cba351a42\" href=\"?note=550ce05cba351a42\" title=\"20-thm-rec-re\">20-thm-rec-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c99615f5fab6afb5\" href=\"?note=c99615f5fab6afb5\" title=\"20-thm-productive-properties\">20-thm-productive-properties</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"17f36cae84cb8ff3\" href=\"?note=17f36cae84cb8ff3\" title=\"20-thm-creative-mcomplete\">20-thm-creative-mcomplete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathcal R,\\qquad \\neg\\operatorname{Creative}(A),\\qquad\n\\neg\\operatorname{mComplete}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\nA\\notin\\mathcal R,\\qquad \\neg\\operatorname{Creative}(A),\\qquad\n\\neg\\operatorname{mComplete}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\omega\\setminus A\">\\(B=\\omega\\setminus A\\)</span> 无限且免疫。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 可计算，特别是 c.e.；把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 自身作为无限 c.e. 子集即违背免疫性。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 创造，定义给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 生产；生产集合性质给无限 c.e. 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq B\">\\(V\\subseteq B\\)</span>，又矛盾。Myhill 的创造性与 m 完备性等价，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 也不是 m 完备。这补齐了原书命题的三项结论，并把误记的 “Theorem 5.2.2” 校正为 Proposition 5.2.2。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 109 / PDF 144；Exercise 5.2.11 给另一条不可分对证明，但不是此证明的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-creative","status":"resolved","id":"f98c8cce12228b4a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt"